      "writtenOn": "2023-01-04T02:59:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dear Nojiri:\nSince the status of curr.batt.flags will be read from battery_get_params(\u0026curr.batt) every time, its previous status will change,\nIt is difficult to control the process in deep_charge_battery through curr.batt.flags,\nCan we add a state ST_PRECHARGE_TIMEROUT for curr.state, and use this state to distinguish the different stages of precharge?",
